# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. ENVIRONMENTS & SECRETS (Critical)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.public.example
.env.keys
.env.local
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.claude/settings.local.json
test_credential.md

# Test credentials handed to agent sessions (owner-supplied, disposable test account).
# NOT covered by the .env* rules above — verified with `git check-ignore`, which returned
# NOT IGNORED at abcba95, so this file was untracked AND committable on this line. With sessions
# self-merging and no human review, gitleaks in CI would only catch it after the secret was
# already in a pushed commit's history.
# Deliberately UNANCHORED (no leading `/`) so a copy in any subdirectory is covered too; an
# anchored rule would protect only the repo root.
test_credential.md
test_credentials.md

# Multi-agent task-claim coordination state (machine-local; see tools/shared_memory.mjs).
.agents/

