bin/
target/
# Next.js / OpenNext build output. Non-anchored (no leading slash) on purpose:
# apps/nao/.gitignore anchors it as /.open-next/, but graphify's gitignore
# matcher only honors non-anchored dir patterns — this keeps the codegraph clean.
.open-next/
.next/

# Flutter/Native Builds
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
/build/
/coverage/
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

